  "ownership_conclusion": {
    "foot": "06_parts/foot and 07_refined/foot retain extra opposite-foot pixels; registered source override applies pinned near_foot mask plus existing connected-component area>=30 rule, yielding exactly one source-designated near boot. The scratch replay equals that override pixel-for-pixel and cut_layers output equals formal parts/foot.png pixel-for-pixel. Formal foot texture is then reused in two separate rig slots with distinct bones/z/tints; it is one single-foot image, not a two-boot atlas.",
    "leg_upper": "One shared texture is used by back/front upper-leg slots. The registered leg_upper source override removes a separately identified hand lobe from the 07_refined layer; formal texture is exact output from cut_layers over this override. The requested source inspection does not prove full posed anatomy.",
    "leg_lower": "One shared texture is used by back/front lower-leg slots. Spec excludes the boot group from leg_lower and the formal texture is exact cut_layers output from 07_refined/leg_lower. This confirms provenance and single-piece mapping, not movement-quality."
  },
